        "TileImage": "$($repository 6b361407-9f8c-48d5-8169-2e9cabd9e3a5).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning. \rYour target is Jawwaad Reza, the unconvicted perpetrator of a market bombing in Egypt. Our client, Morocco, has discovered he is pretending to work in the tunnels under the consulate, and that he plans another attack this afternoon before disappearing. \rYour task is to stage Reza&apos;s suicide, cleanly and silently. Nobody may know this was staged, so no witnesses nor knockouts. \rThis may be difficult. Good Luck.\r(Elusive Target, turn off INSTINCT and the MINIMAP for full experience!)",
